{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/63017651faea59943fb5dd7bf31a8526.avif?t=1772731451\" width=1145 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spinwave Survivors is a fast-paced survival shooter with roguelike elements. Scoot, shoot and boost your way through hordes of drones as you upgrade your weapons and unlock new abilities, all while attempting the survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/f099243e8004d2f5549ac90ae716d6f7.poster.avif?t=1772731451\" width=622 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/f099243e8004d2f5549ac90ae716d6f7.webm?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/f099243e8004d2f5549ac90ae716d6f7.mp4?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/bc8de0865d906410483479226f1ad436.avif?t=1772731451\" width=943 height=85 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> around to avoid enemies, then set up the best angles to unleash a swarm of bullets at them, bonus points for taking down more in a combo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost</strong> through enemies to turn invincible and deal damage to enemies, kill enemies to recharge boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect XP to level up and <strong>unlock powerful upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold</strong> your ground to capture objectives and receive power ups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/46c7be4bfcd2fe523af314683d7fb3ae.poster.avif?t=1772731451\" width=622 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/46c7be4bfcd2fe523af314683d7fb3ae.webm?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/46c7be4bfcd2fe523af314683d7fb3ae.mp4?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/a00de654e466dfececbba25921a4d94d.avif?t=1772731451\" width=914 height=84 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take on challenging but quick runs, designed to last around <strong>10 minutes</strong> and still give plenty of room for experimentation.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your speed</strong> in the time attack game mode, where killing enemies decreases the clock from ticking down. Run out of time and it's game over</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/b9e2a7d19d02f5b29b7afb75395ea178.poster.avif?t=1772731451\" width=622 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/b9e2a7d19d02f5b29b7afb75395ea178.webm?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/b9e2a7d19d02f5b29b7afb75395ea178.mp4?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/15d4a9dad470acc172402cee261d3ad3.avif?t=1772731451\" width=1155 height=85 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your vehicle, weapons and abilities during a run to help you survive longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> to increase your strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 150\u00a0</strong>passive and active upgrades,  with multiple levels to build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete  challenges</strong> to unlock new weapons, upgrades, maps, enemies and drivers, each with their own benefits and playstyles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Game modes</strong>, including endless!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Difficulty tiers</strong> allowing you to choose the right level of challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare scores with global and friends <strong>leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/0d26010b65325a09195aa7b0cc5c338f.poster.avif?t=1772731451\" width=526 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/0d26010b65325a09195aa7b0cc5c338f.webm?t=1772731451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto